# UserPromptSubmit skill suggestion rules
# Format: regex@@skill@@reason (delimiter: @@)
# Advisory suggestions matching user intent to framework skills.
# Shown at most once per skill per session. Suppressed when prompt starts with /skill-name.
# Lines starting with # are comments. Empty lines are skipped.
bug|error|broken|debug|crash|exception|traceback|stack trace@@debug-session@@Structured debugging with root-cause tracing
ship|merge|pull request|deploy|release|push to main@@sprint-end@@Quality gates + PR creation
plan|break down|stories|decompose|requirements|backlog@@ideate@@Decompose into backlog stories
research|investigate|compare|evaluate|look into@@research@@Deep web research with citations
test plan|prepare for testing|QA|manual test@@manual-test@@Generate test plan from recent changes
undo|revert|rollback|go back|start over|discard@@undo-work@@Safe rollback to clean state
status|dashboard|where am I|what sprint|progress@@dashboard@@Sprint status overview
resume|continue|pick up where|what was I@@continue@@Resume from last session
